  <!-- EN: fermenting muffton milk -->
  <DA_FermentingMufftonMilk.label>酿造中的羊奶</DA_FermentingMufftonMilk.label>
  <!-- EN: Fermenting muffton milk that needs to be stirred regularly in order to produce karhan. -->
  <DA_FermentingMufftonMilk.description>酿造中的羊奶，需要规律地搅拌以产出羊奶酒</DA_FermentingMufftonMilk.description>
  
  <!-- EN: karhan -->
  <DA_Karhan.label>羊奶酒</DA_Karhan.label>
  <!-- EN: Muffton milk which has been stirred and fermented for a extended duration. While not as alcoholic as other beverages excessive consumption can lead to alcohol blackouts and, over time, addiction. -->
  <DA_Karhan.description>被搅拌且酿造了一段时间的羊奶。尽管度数不高，喝多了也会断片，而且可能成瘾。</DA_Karhan.description>
