  <!-- EN: muffton milk -->
  <DA_MufftonMilk.label>羊奶</DA_MufftonMilk.label>
  <!-- EN: The strong and pungent milk of a dwarven muffton. It is rather acidic and leaves a sour aftertaste if eaten raw, fortunately it loose most of its acidity when cooked. -->
  <DA_MufftonMilk.description>矮羊浓烈刺鼻的奶。生饮会有点酸味的后韵，幸运的是煮熟后会脱酸。</DA_MufftonMilk.description>
  
